  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 174602e8477056d8909be312705a94b3, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 6.1468
      Chinese: "工厂因便携收纳盒破损报告，将召回部分机器人套装。"
      English: "The factory will take back several robot sets after reports of broken carrying cases."
    - Start: 6.8879
      End: 10.3117
      Chinese: "检查人员称，主要问题是提手强度。"
      English: "Inspectors say the key issue is handle strength."
    - Start: 10.9727
      End: 18.5013
      Chinese: "替换收纳盒送达后将继续测试，据称新盒体足够轻巧，儿童也能携带。"
      English: "Further tests will follow the delivery of replacement cases, described as light enough for children to carry."
